# Building

The project includes a `Makefile` for compilation.

A complete build can be performed using:

```bash
make
```

The compiler used is GCC.

The compilation flags include:

```text
-Wall
-g
-pthread
```

`-Wall` enables a broad set of compiler warnings.

`-g` includes debugging information.

`-pthread` enables the required POSIX threading/semaphore support.

